\"17-df-unary-morley-rank\">17-df-unary-morley-rank</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-df-7.1.4b"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c8c9b6ed48fe2f37\" href=\"?note=c8c9b6ed48fe2f37\" title=\"17-df-unary-morley-rank\">17-df-unary-morley-rank</a> 的语言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_1\">\\(\\aleph_1\\)</span>-饱和结构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak C\">\\(\\mathfrak C\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_C\">\\(T_C\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_C\">\\(F_C\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Rank}_{\\mathfrak C},\\operatorname{Ext}_{\\mathfrak C}\">\\(\\operatorname{Rank}_{\\mathfrak C},\\operatorname{Ext}_{\\mathfrak C}\\)</span>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in F_C\">\\(\\varphi\\in F_C\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\operatorname{Rank}_{\\mathfrak C}(\\varphi,\\alpha)\">\\(\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\operatorname{Rank}_{\\mathfrak C}(\\varphi,\\alpha)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 是候选集合。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MD}_{\\mathfrak C}\">\\(\\operatorname{MD}_{\\mathfrak C}\\)</span> 仅在上述具有序数秩的公式上定义，值是正的有限基数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MD}_{\\mathfrak C}(\\varphi)=k\n\\leftrightarrow k\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\n\\land\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\n(\\operatorname{Rank}_{\\mathfrak C}(\\varphi,\\alpha)\n\\land|\\operatorname{Ext}_{\\mathfrak C}(\\varphi,\\alpha)|=k).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{MD}_{\\mathfrak C}(\\varphi)=k\n\\leftrightarrow k\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\n\\land\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\n(\\operatorname{Rank}_{\\mathfrak C}(\\varphi,\\alpha)\n\\land|\\operatorname{Ext}_{\\mathfrak C}(\\varphi,\\alpha)|=k).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 p497 将度数直接定义为该层残余集的极大一致扩张数量；因此度数是正整数。与秩使用同一个全参数结构及一元公式域。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-unary-morley-rank","status":"resolved","id":"c8c9b6ed48fe2f37","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-unary-morley-rank]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-unary-morley-rank","status":"resolved","id":"c8c9b6ed48fe2f37","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[17-df-unary-morley-rank]] 的语言 $L$、$\\aleph_1$-饱和结构 $\\mathfrak C$、$T_C$、$F_C$、$\\mathrm{Ord}$ 及 $\\operatorname{Rank}_{\\mathfrak C},\\operatorname{Ext}_{\\mathfrak C}$。\n$\\varphi\\in F_C$ 且 $\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\operatorname{Rank}_{\\mathfrak C}(\\varphi,\\alpha)$；$k$ 是候选集合。\n$\\operatorname{MD}_{\\mathfrak C}$ 仅在上述具有序数秩的公式上定义，值是正的有限基数。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\aleph_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak C","display":false},{"tex":"T_C","display":false},{"tex":"F_C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Rank}_{\\mathfrak C},\\operatorname{Ext}_{\\mathfrak C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in F_C","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\operatorname{Rank}_{\\mathfrak C}(\\varphi,\\alpha)","display":false